  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/03f606139c736cc1af8c6f5c78ea44c324f88530185109c0f836e68c8ced7a54.png] \n\nBy substituting the following symbols,\n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \nLetters\n\n \n A\n B\n C\n D\n \n \n\n \n \nMeaning\n\n \n +\n -\n ×\n ÷\n \n \n\n \n\n(1) 66 B 2 D 54 C 18 = 135\n\nLHS = 66 - __**2 ÷ 54**__ × 18 \n\n= 66 - __**0.037 × 18 **__\n\n= __**66 - 0.666**__\n\n= 65.334 ≠ 135\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\n(2) 45 A 5 C 7 D 14 = 77\n\nLHS = 45 + 5 × __**7 ÷ 14**__\n\n= 45 + __**5 × 0.5**__\n\n=** **__**45 + 2.5**__\n\n= 47.5 ≠ 77\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\n**(3) 45 D 5 C 7 A 14 = 77 **\n\n**LHS = __45 ÷ 5__ × 7 + 14 **\n\n**=__ 9 × 7__ + 14**\n\n**= __63 + 14__**\n\n**= 77**\n\n**LHS = RHS**\n\n(4) 66 C 2 B 54 D 18 = 135\n\nLHS = 66 × 2 - __**54 ÷ 18**__\n\n= **__66 × 2__** - 3\n\n= __**132 - 3**__\n\n= 129 ≠ 135\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, **45 D 5 C 7 A 14 = 77 **is the correct equation.",
